      "comment": "DOONSIDE LEWIS (1) is a talented type who notched his 31st career success when too good (25.34) at Maitland last time. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from five starts. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Hard to go past. ZIPPING HOPKINS (4) turned in a solid run fresh when finishing in the placings at Nowra in a Mix 1/2/3 (20.69). Solid record at the distance winning 14 races. Expected to feature again. PROWESS (2) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at Wentworth Park over 520m behind Kingsbrae Brett (30.62) in a Mix 1/2/3. Leading chance. MIGHTY TROJAN (8) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
